# Gokole Park & Guesthouse Website - Part 2

## Project Overview
This project presents a responsive, visually polished web application for Gokole Park & Guesthouse, fully styled with CSS3 and enhanced with modern JavaScript interactivity.

---

## Part 2 Changelog & Iterations
All updates made based on lecturer/marker feedback and Part 2 styling requirements:

| Date | Category | Description of Changes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 2026-09-18 | **CSS Styling** | Refactored `style.css` into a modular design using reset rules, Google Fonts, standard color schemes, and flex/grid card layouts. |
| 2026-09-18 | **Responsiveness** | Added media query breakpoints for desktop, tablet, and mobile views to ensure seamless vertical stacking on smaller screens. |
| 2026-09-18 | **HTML & Images** | Updated image wrappers with relative units and responsive markup (`srcset` / `sizes`) to optimize image delivery across devices. |
| 2026-09-18 | **JavaScript Clean-up** | Consolidated DOM listeners, added defensive safety checks for missing form inputs, and optimized scroll reveal event listeners. |
| 2026-09-18 | **Feedback Adjustments** | Corrected structural HTML tags across pages and updated navigation active state styling. |

